@startuml lld-us5-class
title LLD-US5 See all accounts and balances: class diagram
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
class AccountController <<controller>> {
  + list()
}
class AccountService <<service>> {
  - cache 30 s
  + accounts(cust)
}
class CbsAdapter <<adapter>> {
  + accounts(cust)
  + balance(acc)
}
AccountController --> AccountService
AccountService --> CbsAdapter
@enduml